# Third-party notices

Work in this repository that builds on someone else's is credited here.

## The exercise library

`exercises/` is a hand-written library of movements. Its English naming and its
equipment and body-part vocabulary follow the ExerciseDB v1 metadata that
[hasaneyldrm/exercises-dataset](https://github.com/hasaneyldrm/exercises-dataset)
redistributes under the MIT licence, whose full text is in that repository.

Only the metadata informed this library. None of that dataset's images or
animations are committed here or shipped with the app: their ownership is
disputed, and the library needs none of them. The entries themselves — which
movements are kept, which near-duplicates are merged, the metrics, the tags and
every Swedish name — are written for this repository.

Swedish names are original translations. They have not been reviewed by a
native speaker, and nothing here describes them as though they had.
